sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Dev as Developer
  participant GH as GitHub
  participant CI as Actions (ubuntu-latest)
  participant R as Self-hosted runner
  participant E as Dev / Staging / Prod
  actor Rev as Reviewer
  Dev->>GH: git push main
  GH->>CI: start workflow
  CI->>CI: pytest + coverage gate
  CI-->>R: test passed
  R->>R: docker build envflow-app:SHA, envflow-nginx:SHA
  R->>E: deploy.sh development 8081 SHA
  E-->>R: /health 200, version = SHA
  R->>E: deploy.sh staging 8082 SHA
  E-->>R: /health 200, version = SHA
  R->>Rev: production waiting for approval
  Rev->>R: approve
  R->>E: deploy.sh production 8083 SHA
  E-->>R: /health 200, version = SHA
  R-->>GH: run green, environment URLs recorded
